1
00:00:20,270 --> 00:00:22,250
Neon drops snap like drum hits,

2
00:00:22,250 --> 00:00:24,140
bouncing off the city skin.

3
00:00:24,140 --> 00:00:25,940
Your silhouette cuts the haze—

4
00:00:25,940 --> 00:00:27,200
funky, crooked,

5
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:29,690
moving in a rhythm I can’t pin down.

6
00:00:29,690 --> 00:00:31,890
A tiny bell pops in the corner,

7
00:00:31,890 --> 00:00:33,600
too cute for this place,

8
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:36,810
but it lands right where my pulse jumps.

9
00:00:36,810 --> 00:00:38,370
You tilt your head,

10
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:39,330
late on purpose—

11
00:00:39,330 --> 00:00:41,390
like you’re syncing with a beat

12
00:00:41,390 --> 00:00:42,700
only you can hear.

13
00:00:42,700 --> 00:00:45,840
Sax glitches behind you,

14
00:00:45,840 --> 00:00:47,410
piano shards scatter,

15
00:00:47,410 --> 00:00:49,840
and the bassline curls around my ankles,

16
00:00:49,840 --> 00:00:53,290
pulling me closer.

17
00:00:53,290 --> 00:00:56,860
Oh, you’ve got that neon bounce—

18
00:00:56,860 --> 00:00:59,420
breaking all the rules I lean on.

19
00:00:59,420 --> 00:01:01,250
Every step you take

20
00:01:01,250 --> 00:01:04,560
rewrites the groove beneath me.

21
00:01:04,560 --> 00:01:05,710
I fall in,

22
00:01:05,710 --> 00:01:06,530
off-balance,

23
00:01:06,530 --> 00:01:08,590
charmed by the sparks you drop

24
00:01:08,590 --> 00:01:13,300
like sweet electric confetti.

25
00:01:22,340 --> 00:01:25,450
Your shadow flickers across chrome walls,

26
00:01:25,450 --> 00:01:26,840
split into pieces,

27
00:01:26,840 --> 00:01:28,590
reassembling on every beat.

28
00:01:28,590 --> 00:01:31,020
The funk bass punches forward—

29
00:01:31,020 --> 00:01:32,190
tight, playful,

30
00:01:32,190 --> 00:01:35,100
dragging the whole night sideways.

31
00:01:35,100 --> 00:01:36,830
You hum a note, soft and crooked,

32
00:01:36,830 --> 00:01:39,630
and the room bends toward you.

33
00:01:39,630 --> 00:01:42,160
Your smile hits like a syncopated click—

34
00:01:42,160 --> 00:01:43,870
cute, unexpected,

35
00:01:43,870 --> 00:01:45,810
a pastel shock in a dark hall.

36
00:01:45,810 --> 00:01:46,890
Drums stutter,

37
00:01:46,890 --> 00:01:47,700
lights ripple,

38
00:01:47,700 --> 00:01:50,940
and suddenly I’m swaying where your rhythm spills.

39
00:01:50,940 --> 00:01:54,690
Oh, you’ve got that neon bounce—

40
00:01:54,690 --> 00:01:57,180
breaking all the rules I lean on.

41
00:01:57,180 --> 00:01:59,050
Every step you take

42
00:01:59,050 --> 00:02:02,220
rewrites the groove beneath me.

43
00:02:02,220 --> 00:02:03,510
I fall in,

44
00:02:03,510 --> 00:02:04,390
off-balance,

45
00:02:04,390 --> 00:02:06,360
charmed by the sparks you drop

46
00:02:06,360 --> 00:02:11,370
like sweet electric confetti.

47
00:02:11,370 --> 00:02:13,320
We move in loops and angles—

48
00:02:13,320 --> 00:02:15,800
funk riffs folding under jazz smoke,

49
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:20,260
electronic shards drifting like fireflies.

50
00:02:20,260 --> 00:02:21,960
You brush past me,

51
00:02:21,960 --> 00:02:23,880
a tiny chime ringing—

52
00:02:23,880 --> 00:02:26,350
and the whole beat resets

53
00:02:26,350 --> 00:02:31,090
around your outline.

54
00:03:13,310 --> 00:03:16,750
Oh, you’ve got that neon bounce—

55
00:03:16,750 --> 00:03:19,400
pulling me into your orbit.

56
00:03:19,400 --> 00:03:21,090
Every wrong beat,

57
00:03:21,090 --> 00:03:22,750
every twist in your step—

58
00:03:22,750 --> 00:03:24,850
I fall deeper,

59
00:03:24,850 --> 00:03:26,510
spinning in your circuit.

60
00:03:26,510 --> 00:03:27,480
The night sparks,

61
00:03:27,480 --> 00:03:28,640
the funk snaps,

62
00:03:28,640 --> 00:03:31,910
and I keep swaying off-center—

63
00:03:31,910 --> 00:03:33,280
right where you want me.

64
00:03:33,280 --> 00:03:36,340
Leave the harmony unfinished—

65
00:03:36,340 --> 00:03:38,540
I’ll follow your pulse anyway.

66
00:03:38,540 --> 00:03:41,850
As long as your neon shadow sways,

67
00:03:41,850 --> 00:03:48,740
I’ll drift in that funky crooked groove

68
00:03:48,740 --> 00:03:52,200
where you and I collide.

